@page "/legal/refund"
<PageTitle>Refund Policy — CrowdFund AI</PageTitle>
<div class="page-container py-5" style="max-width:800px;">
    <h1 class="fw-bold">Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: 9 November 2026</p>
    <div class="cf-card">
        <p>Donations are generally final once captured by the payment processor. Refunds may be issued when:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>A technical duplicate charge occurred</li>
            <li>A campaign is suspended for verified fraud before funds are paid out</li>
            <li>Required by applicable payment network or consumer law</li>
            <li>The creator and platform jointly approve a goodwill refund</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Platform fees already remitted to payment processors may be non-recoverable. Refund timing depends on PayPal/bank rails (typically 5–10 business days after approval).</p>
        <p>Request refunds via support with donation ID and capture ID from your receipt.</p>
    </div>
</div>
